{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you will be cleared of this my oath.</b> Meaning: from taking a wife for his son from his birthplace; but the oath regarding taking a daughter of Canaan in her place still stands, for that is a matter dependent on his own hand." "<b>Only my son, etc.</b> He did not administer an oath to him regarding this matter; it is nothing but an answer to his saying ״הֶהָשֵׁב אָשִׁיב״, etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:42:56.582280180Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}